      "content": "it doesn't feel worth it. even the small things feel heavy and meaningless. i just spend every day waiting for the feeling to go away but it just gets deeper. it's like i'm stuck in this limbo, just waiting for something to happen so i can stop feeling like this. it feels like i'm just a shell waiting to be broken.",
